notes.notes:
Friends! Our team had a happy event in July. We all successfully defended our game before the masters of the gaming industry, when each team member told and showed their part of the work on the game as part of the defense of final certification works on the educational program "Game Project Management" at THE HSE. It was there, during the training, that we gathered as a team to create the Unforgotten project.

In addition to good reviews, we received a lot of incredibly useful feedback. After discussing everything within the team, we were able to convert the feedback received on the defense, as well as the feedback received from the first demo players, into our first major update. We would like to Express our special gratitude to the people who have reviewed our game on YouTube. Many of the points that you paid attention to in your reviews, we were able to correct in this update!

We will continue to work on improving the gameplay, so that by the time of release, our game can bring you the maximum of positive emotions. Especially important to us is feedback from you, our players! Please write your impressions in the comments.

Optimizations:
⁃ updated some backgrounds;
⁃ updated the appearance of the chest puzzle;
⁃ added facial animation of characters (blinking);
⁃ added saving in key points;
⁃ updated management on PC;
⁃ updated the style of writing direct speech in the text;
⁃ added the ability to switch the language without restarting the app.
